TopoPyScale 0.2.2 as used for the East River forcing: changes to TopoPyScale/solar_geom.py and
TopoPyScale/topo_scale.py of release v0.2.2 (https://github.com/ArcticSnow/TopoPyScale, tag v0.2.2,
commit ec6a89f). Applied, it gives the branch v0.2.2-eastriver of https://github.com/mmazzolini/TopoPyScale
and the package installed in the conda env `downscaling` (checked file by file). See README.md.

    git clone https://github.com/ArcticSnow/TopoPyScale && cd TopoPyScale && git checkout v0.2.2
    git apply --whitespace=nowarn ../topopyscale_v0.2.2_eastriver.patch && pip install .

